{"title":"Career Roadmap · Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyses and communicates data to help organisations make better decisions. The role combines statistics, SQL, spreadsheets, visualisation, business understanding and increasingly AI-assisted analytics.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Data Science & AI for Business"},"about":[{"label":"Start","text":"Year 1 UG · 2026"},{"label":"Typical first step","text":"Data Analyst Intern / Business Analytics Intern / BI Intern"},{"label":"Long-term direction","text":"Data Analyst → Senior Data Analyst → Analytics Lead/Manager"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Data Analytics Intern, BI Intern, Business Analytics Intern"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Data Analyst → Business/Data Analyst → Senior Analyst"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Data Analyst → Analytics Lead → Analytics Manager"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Head of Analytics, Decision Intelligence Lead, Data Strategy Leader"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA student specialising in Data Science & AI for Business, this is a strong interdisciplinary pathway because the degree provides business context while the student can deliberately build the technical skills required for analytics roles."},{"type":"p","text":"The student should aim to become more than a dashboard creator:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Problem","Data","Analysis","Insight","Recommendation","Measured Business Impact"]}]},{"heading":"Career-Route Check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Data Science & AI","Data Analytics Internship","Junior Data Analyst / Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Lead","Analytics Manager"]},{"type":"note","label":"Alignment","text":"Very strong."},{"type":"p","text":"The main advantage of this degree is the combination of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business knowledge","Data","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"However, the student must develop sufficient technical depth in SQL, statistics, Excel, Power BI and Python. The degree title alone will not establish technical competence."},{"type":"note","label":"Timeline assumption","text":"A 4-year undergraduate programme beginning in 2026 is assumed, with graduation around 2030."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are planning horizons rather than guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Business + Excel + quantitative fundamentals"},{"text":"University + Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"Business analysis workbook"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Statistics + data visualisation"},{"text":"University + NPTEL"},{"text":"Statistical analysis project"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"SQL + databases"},{"text":"SQLBolt + PostgreSQL"},{"text":"50+ analytical SQL queries"},{"text":"Technical analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Power BI + Power Query + DAX"},{"text":"Microsoft"},{"text":"Interactive dashboard"},{"text":"BI capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Python + pandas + NumPy"},{"text":"Python + pandas"},{"text":"Python EDA project"},{"text":"Programming"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Machine learning fundamentals + internship"},{"text":"scikit-learn + industry"},{"text":"ML/business analytics project"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics + forecasting"},{"text":"Applied projects"},{"text":"End-to-end AI analytics case"},{"text":"Future capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Capstone + portfolio + placements"},{"text":"GitHub + mock interviews"},{"text":"6–10 strong projects"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful foundations include Microsoft Excel, SQLBolt, Python documentation and pandas.","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Data Analyst Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulas"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"SUMIFS/COUNTIFS"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Basic financial/business modelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Excel remains highly useful for business analysis even when SQL and Python are available."}]},{"heading":"SQL","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SQL should become one of the student's strongest technical skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"NULL handling"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Query optimisation fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice with:"},{"type":"p","text":"SQLBolt","url":"https://sqlbolt.com/"}]},{"heading":"Statistics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Mean/median/mode"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Probability fundamentals"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"A/B testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good analyst should understand that:"},{"type":"p","text":"Correlation does not establish causation."}]},{"heading":"Power BI / Business Intelligence","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data import"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"DAX fundamentals"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"},{"text":"Drill-through"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"KPI cards"},{"text":"Data storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/power-platform/products/power-bi"}]},{"heading":"Python","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn enough Python to perform serious analytical work."},{"type":"p","text":"Core stack:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"seaborn"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"EDA"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Visualisation"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Basic machine learning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"NumPy\npandas\nscikit-learn","url":"https://numpy.org/"}]},{"heading":"AI for Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BBA Data Science & AI student should learn to use AI as an analytical accelerator, not as a substitute for understanding data."},{"type":"p","text":"Use AI for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL generation"},{"text":"Python assistance"},{"text":"Data cleaning suggestions"},{"text":"Exploratory analysis"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Data summarisation"},{"text":"Natural-language querying"},{"text":"Dashboard narratives"},{"text":"Hypothesis generation"},{"text":"Report drafting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But always validate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculations"},{"text":"SQL logic"},{"text":"Statistical assumptions"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Sources"},{"text":"Model outputs"}]}]},{"heading":"Business Understanding","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is what can differentiate a BBA Data Analyst from a purely technical analyst."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"HR"},{"text":"Customer behaviour"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn common KPIs such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Customer acquisition cost"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Forecast accuracy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Portfolio Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Target 8–10 substantial projects by graduation."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Sales Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Region"},{"text":"Salesperson"},{"text":"Customer segment"},{"text":"Monthly trends"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Customer Churn Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer characteristics"},{"text":"Churn patterns"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"High-risk segments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Marketing Campaign Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Campaign performance"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"ROI/ROAS"},{"text":"Customer segments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Financial Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue dashboard"},{"text":"Expense analysis"},{"text":"Budget vs actual"},{"text":"Profitability analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — E-commerce Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Traffic","Product view","Cart","Checkout","Purchase"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — HR Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Employee demographics"},{"text":"Tenure"},{"text":"Department performance"},{"text":"Absenteeism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 7 — Supply Chain Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Stock-outs"},{"text":"Delivery performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 8 — Python EDA"},{"type":"p","text":"Use pandas to perform a complete:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Cleaning","EDA","Statistical analysis","Visualisation","Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 9 — Predictive Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simple model for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Customer conversion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Explain the model's limitations instead of presenting prediction as certainty."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 10 — AI-Powered Analytics Case"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an analytical workflow where AI assists with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data exploration"},{"text":"Report generation"},{"text":"Insight discovery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then independently validate the results."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it can lead to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + Excel + BI + statistics"},{"text":"NPTEL + projects"},{"text":"Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + Python + statistics"},{"text":"Python/pandas"},{"text":"Senior Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"BI Analytics"},{"text":"Power BI + SQL + DAX"},{"text":"Microsoft"},{"text":"BI Lead"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Marketing + SQL + BI"},{"text":"Marketing projects"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Financial Analytics"},{"text":"Finance + Excel + SQL + BI"},{"text":"Finance projects"},{"text":"Finance Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + funnels + experimentation"},{"text":"Product projects"},{"text":"Product Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Operations Analytics"},{"text":"Forecasting + optimisation + BI"},{"text":"Operations projects"},{"text":"Operations Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + forecasting + BI"},{"text":"Supply-chain projects"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"People Analytics"},{"text":"HR + SQL + statistics"},{"text":"HR projects"},{"text":"People Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Risk Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics + SQL + Python"},{"text":"Risk projects"},{"text":"Risk Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"AI/Decision Analytics"},{"text":"Python + AI + statistics"},{"text":"AI projects"},{"text":"Decision Intelligence Lead"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-Year Honours / Research Variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If the programme has a fourth-year honours/research pathway, use it for a deeper analytical question."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Predicting customer churn using behavioural and transactional data and identifying the factors most strongly associated with retention.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The project should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research question"},{"text":"Data preparation"},{"text":"Exploratory analysis"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Model development"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"Business interpretation"},{"text":"Limitations"},{"text":"Recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid presenting an ML model's accuracy as equivalent to business usefulness."},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and Stay Relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Routine reporting, dashboard creation and basic data cleaning will increasingly be automated."},{"type":"p","text":"The valuable analyst will therefore move toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Descriptive","Diagnostic","Predictive","Prescriptive","Decision Intelligence"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop capabilities in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Advanced forecasting"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Decision science"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Business strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term profile should become:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Domain","Data","Statistics","AI","Decision-Making"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector / Research"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / ecosystem","Relevant exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"NITI Aayog","url":"https://www.niti.gov.in/"},{"text":"Policy and data analysis"}],[{"text":"Ministry of Statistics & Programme Implementation","url":"https://www.mospi.gov.in/"},{"text":"Statistics and economic data"}],[{"text":"Reserve Bank of India","url":"https://www.rbi.org.in/"},{"text":"Financial/economic analytics"}],[{"text":"SEBI","url":"https://www.sebi.gov.in/"},{"text":"Financial-market data"}],[{"text":"CAG of India","url":"https://cag.gov.in/"},{"text":"Audit and public-finance analytics"}],[{"text":"National Informatics Centre","url":"https://www.nic.in/"},{"text":"Government data/digital systems"}],[{"text":"IITs / IIMs / universities"},{"text":"Research and data projects"}],[{"text":"Public-sector enterprises"},{"text":"Business/operations analytics"}],[{"text":"PM Internship Scheme"},{"text":"Corporate exposure, subject to current eligibility"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"PM Internship Scheme","url":"https://pminternship.mca.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Private-sector internships"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Business Analytics Intern"},{"text":"BI Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Product Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Financial Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Operations Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Risk Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Data Science Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Good industry categories include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IT services"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Telecom"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Insurance"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications in Demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning area","Purpose"],"rows":[[{"text":"Microsoft Power BI / PL-300 preparation"},{"text":"BI capability"}],[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Business analysis"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Database analytics"}],[{"text":"NPTEL Statistics/Data Analytics"},{"text":"Statistical foundation"}],[{"text":"Python for Data Analysis"},{"text":"Analytical programming"}],[{"text":"Google Data Analytics learning"},{"text":"Structured analytics"}],[{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Alternative BI platform"}],[{"text":"Statistics / A/B testing"},{"text":"Analytical validity"}],[{"text":"Cloud analytics fundamentals"},{"text":"Modern data infrastructure"}],[{"text":"Machine Learning fundamentals"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"}],[{"text":"AI for Business Analytics"},{"text":"Modern workflows"}],[{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Communication"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificate prices and availability should be verified from the issuing organisation before publishing them as current facts."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst Trainee"},{"text":"Business Data Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Analytics Associate"},{"text":"BI Analyst"},{"text":"BI Analyst Trainee"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"},{"text":"MIS Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Customer Insights Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"Data Quality Analyst"},{"text":"Decision Support Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics Consultant Trainee"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Role-to-skill mapping"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + Excel + statistics + BI"},{"text":"Analytics portfolio"}],[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Business + SQL + requirements"},{"text":"Business case"}],[{"text":"BI Analyst"},{"text":"Power BI + SQL + DAX"},{"text":"Dashboard portfolio"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing + analytics"},{"text":"Campaign analysis"}],[{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Finance + Excel + BI"},{"text":"Financial model"}],[{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + product metrics"},{"text":"Product case"}],[{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Excel + SQL + forecasting"},{"text":"Operations project"}],[{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"Statistics + research"},{"text":"Research project"}],[{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + forecasting + BI"},{"text":"Supply-chain dashboard"}],[{"text":"Analytics Consultant"},{"text":"Analytics + business communication"},{"text":"Consulting case studies"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Analyst is a realistic direct-entry role for this degree, provided the student has actual technical evidence."},{"type":"p","text":"A graduate who only knows business theory may struggle against candidates with stronger SQL, statistics and portfolio experience."},{"type":"p","text":"The minimum competitive technical foundation should be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","SQL","Statistics","Power BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The stronger profile adds:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","pandas","AI","experimentation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best suited for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Analytics + management"}],[{"text":"MBA Data Analytics"},{"text":"Business/data leadership"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"Technical analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Statistics"},{"text":"Statistical depth"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Business Analytics"},{"text":"Advanced business analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"AI/ML direction"}],[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"Stronger technical foundation"}],[{"text":"M.Tech Data Science/AI"},{"text":"Technical transition where eligibility permits"}],[{"text":"M.Com Business Analytics"},{"text":"Commerce + analytics"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Data Analytics"},{"text":"Specialisation"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Business Analytics"},{"text":"Business analytics"}],[{"text":"PhD"},{"text":"Research/academia"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Which route?"},{"type":"p","text":"Want management leadership?\n→ MBA Business Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Want technical data science?\n→ M.Sc Data Science / Statistics / AI or another technically appropriate programme"},{"type":"p","text":"Want software/data engineering?\n→ MCA / technically appropriate master's"},{"type":"p","text":"Want research?\n→ M.Sc/M.Tech + PhD"},{"type":"p","text":"A second degree should be chosen based on the actual skill gap rather than simply collecting another qualification."},{"type":"h","text":"Scholarships and Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential routes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UGC fellowships"},{"text":"University research assistantships"},{"text":"Institute-funded PhD positions"},{"text":"PMRF for eligible doctoral programmes"},{"text":"CSIR/other discipline-specific fellowships where applicable"}]},{"type":"p","text":"PMRF","url":"https://www.pmrf.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility and funding conditions vary by programme and year."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad — Country by Country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities / ecosystem","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Carnegie Mellon, Georgia Tech, University of Washington, UT Austin"},{"text":"University funding, assistantships, Fulbright"},{"text":"Quantitative prerequisites"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Imperial, Warwick, Edinburgh, Manchester"},{"text":"University scholarships, Chevening where eligible"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"TUM, LMU, Mannheim, RWTH ecosystem"},{"text":"DAAD + university funding"},{"text":"Degree and quantitative fit"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Toronto, UBC, Waterloo, McGill"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Melbourne, UNSW, Monash, ANU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic + English requirements"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Erasmus University Rotterdam, Tilburg, Amsterdam"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Quantitative requirements"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, SMU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic profile"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful scholarship resources:"},{"type":"p","text":"USIEF / Fulbright-Nehru\nDAAD India","url":"https://www.usief.org.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Application profile"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong BBA academic record"},{"text":"SQL portfolio"},{"text":"Power BI dashboards"},{"text":"Python projects"},{"text":"Statistics coursework"},{"text":"AI/ML project"},{"text":"Analytics internship"},{"text":"Research/capstone project"},{"text":"Strong SOP"},{"text":"Academic recommendations"},{"text":"English test where required"},{"text":"GRE/GMAT only where required or useful"}]}]},{"heading":"Going Forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Data Science & AI Student","Data Analytics Intern","Junior Data Analyst / Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Lead / BI Lead","Analytics Manager","Head of Analytics / Data Strategy Leader"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analyst → Data Scientist"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible if the student develops deeper:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"ML deployment fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Another:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analyst","Product Analyst","Product Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Another:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Analyst","Business Analyst","Strategy/Consulting"]},{"type":"p","text":"Another:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analyst → Analytics Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"with stronger SQL, data modelling, transformation and engineering skills."},{"type":"h","text":"PhD Directions"},{"type":"p","text":"A Data Analyst can eventually pursue research in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Econometrics"},{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Decision Science"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Financial Analytics"},{"text":"Healthcare Analytics"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analytics"},{"text":"Human-AI Interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The future analyst will increasingly work with AI agents, natural-language analytics and automated decision-support systems."},{"type":"p","text":"Routine tasks such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic SQL generation"},{"text":"Standard reports"},{"text":"Dashboard narratives"},{"text":"Data summarisation"},{"text":"Simple visualisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"will become easier to automate."},{"type":"p","text":"The durable advantage will therefore shift toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem framing","statistical judgement","domain knowledge","causal reasoning","AI validation","decision-making"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Domain","Statistics","Data","AI","Strategic Decision-Making"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A senior analytics professional should be able to move beyond:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Here is what happened.\""},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Here is what happened, why it happened, what is likely to happen next, what we should do, and how we will measure whether the decision worked.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong BBA Data Science & AI for Business graduate should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine learning fundamentals"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"Responsible AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business application"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Financial analytics"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Operations analytics"},{"text":"Product analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"},{"text":"Presentation"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["8–10 meaningful analytics projects","1–2 internships","1 major end-to-end capstone."],"sep":"+","label":"Portfolio target"}]}]}